{"url": "https://x.com/DannyLimanseta/status/2093381938484810054", "id": "2093381938484810054", "text": "I turned my Grok Bot that generates art assets into a template that you can use.\n\n- It will generate 2D art assets in the style that you specify\n- It can also generate multiple mockups of your game idea in multiple styles\n- It can crop your art assets into separate PNG assets for your game\n- If you're making a 3D models, you can even ask it to generate a 3D model concept art, then ask it to generate the 3D model in Tripo or Meshy (you would need to log into Tripo or Meshy in the Bot's PC to do that)\n\nThe beauty of this template is that you can personalise it to exactly how you want it and the bot will remember your preferences and specific workflow.\n\nGet the template here:\nhttps://x.ai/bot/oSvAMKX_ahD56ZmgwtRys", "raw_text": {"text": "I turned my Grok Bot that generates art assets into a template that you can use.\n\n- It will generate 2D art assets in the style that you specify\n- It can also generate multiple mockups of your game idea in multiple styles\n- It can crop your art assets into separate PNG assets for your game\n- If you're making a 3D models, you can even ask it to generate a 3D model concept art, then ask it to generate the 3D model in Tripo or Meshy (you would need to log into Tripo or Meshy in the Bot's PC to do that)\n\nThe beauty of this template is that you can personalise it to exactly how you want it and the bot will remember your preferences and specific workflow.\n\nGet the template here:\nhttps://t.co/Y515sHY7EC", "display_text_range": [0, 705], "facets": [{"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2093381373101027328", "display": "pic.x.com/BmyiD72MTE", "original": "https://t.co/BmyiD72MTE", "replacement": "https://x.com/DannyLimanseta/status/2093381938484810054/photo/1"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2093381528990699520", "display": "pic.x.com/BmyiD72MTE", "original": "https://t.co/BmyiD72MTE", "replace